msgid "Appearance"
msgstr ""

#: includes/help.php
msgid "The block draws no frame around the document: there is no border, no rounded corners and no backdrop color, so the pages sit directly on the page background. Only the toolbar, when enabled, has a separator line."
msgstr ""

#: includes/help.php
msgid "The appearance can be changed from the theme stylesheet or from a custom CSS plugin:"
